## Hub API Contract

The HubConnector expects the hub to expose these endpoints:

### Health Check
```
GET /api/health
Response: { ok: true }
```

### User Info
```
GET /api/user
Authorization: Bearer {hubToken}
Response: { id, email, username, providers }
```

### Create Workspace
```
POST /api/providers/{provider}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {hubToken}
Body: { repository, branch, cpuCores, ... }
Response: Workspace
```

### Get Workspace
```
GET /api/providers/{provider}/workspaces/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {hubToken}
Response: Workspace
```

### List Workspaces
```
GET /api/providers/{provider}/workspaces?status=running&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {hubToken}
Response: Workspace[]
```

### Delete Workspace
```
DELETE /api/providers/{provider}/workspaces/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {hubToken}
Response: 204 No Content
```

### Start/Stop Workspace
```
POST /api/providers/{provider}/workspaces/{id}/start
POST /api/providers/{provider}/workspaces/{id}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {hubToken}
Response: 204 No Content
```

