## Status Mapping

Maps Coder's workspace status to the Provider interface's `WorkspaceStatus`.

```typescript
function mapCoderStatusToWorkspaceStatus(status: CoderWorkspaceStatus): WorkspaceStatus {
  switch (status) {
    case 'pending':    return 'creating';
    case 'starting':   return 'starting';
    case 'running':    return 'running';
    case 'stopping':   return 'stopping';
    case 'stopped':    return 'stopped';
    case 'deleting':   return 'deleting';
    case 'deleted':    return 'deleting';
    case 'canceling':  return 'failed';
    case 'canceled':   return 'failed';
    case 'failed':     return 'failed';
    default:           return 'failed';
  }
}
```

This mapping lives in the SDK so both CoderProvider and the hub can reuse it.

